 ## Unreleased — 1.4.0
 
-Nothing yet.
+### The usage ledger moves to the home directory
+
+`ingest` and `usage` now read and write `~/.smysl/usage.log` instead of
+`.smysl/usage.log` under the current project. Usage was per-checkout, so
+switching projects — or running from a scratch directory, as CI does —
+started a new ledger with no history in it. One ledger per machine tracks
+cost across every project instead. `Ledger::PATH` is unchanged and still
+names the relative form; `Ledger::home_path()` is the new entry point that
+resolves it against `$HOME` (or `%USERPROFILE%`), falling back to the
+current directory when neither is set.
 
 ---
 
